        },
        {
          "text": " Nio Basifu bacha khu Saulo e Kibea mala bamuboolela bali, “Daudi ekisa mwifwe mu libina e Horeshi khu sikulu sia Hakila, siili ebunafubo wa Yesimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono omwami waaba ne wenya khukhwiikha wiche ne kumwoyo kwowo kwoosi, yiikha wiche. Kimilimo kiefwe kilaba khukhwakanisia Daudi khwiwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Saulo abakobosia ali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amubiite enywe chikhabi khulwe khu khukholela siisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cha mu manyilisie mala mubone abuundu niio ali, lundi mumanye naanu omuboone ebweeneyo. Sikila naulila bali ali omubacha lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola nono mala mumanyilisie abuundu oosi niio ekisanga mala mukobole mumboolele bung'ali. Nio ekhache ne nanywe. Ne aaba ne ali mu lukoongo, aba ekhamuyime mu baandu boosi ba Yuda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Basifu benyokha mala bacha ebweeni wa Saulo e Sifu. Nono Daudi ne babaandu bewe baba mu sichiimi sia Maoni mu Araba, ebunafubo owa Yesimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Saulo ne babaandu bewe bacha khuenja Daudi mala Daudi aulila. Nono Daudi ekha khu lwanda luli mu sichiimi sia Maoni. Ne nga Saulo ne aulila ako aloonda khu Daudi mu sichiimi sia Maoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ne babaandu bewe bakeendanga ne bacha lubeka lulala lwe lukulu ne Daudi ne babaandu bewe bacha lubeka luluundi. Ne Daudi akeendanga khangu, khukhwilukha Saulo ne babaandu bewe ba baaba ne bembiie Daudi ne babaandu bewe khubatiila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwene ao, omurumwa echa khu Saulo ne aloma ali, “Khola khangu wiche. Bafilisiti balikho bebwaakala sibala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Saulo alekha khuloonda khu Daudi mala acha khu khuupana ne Bafilisiti. Nono abuundu ao alaangwa ali, lulwanda lwe khukhwilukha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Daudi aniina khukhwama abwenao mala amenya mu libina e Engedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
